---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout lang="en" title="Support, Laps" description="Questions about Laps, and how to reach us." page="support">
  <article class="doc">
    <p class="kicker">Laps</p>
    <h1>Support</h1>
    <p class="lead">Laps tells you how many pages to read each day, so you finish every read of your textbook by your finish date.</p>
    <p>Write to <a class="link" href="mailto:laps@wlswo.me">laps@wlswo.me</a>. We usually reply within a few days.</p>
    <h2>Common questions</h2>
    <div class="box">
      <dl>
        <dt>I fell behind. What now?</dt>
        <dd>Nothing to do. Laps spreads the pages you missed over the days left until your finish date, and your pace shows how many more pages a day that means.</dd>
        <dt>What is free, and what does the Lifetime Pass add?</dt>
        <dd>Free gives you one book on the Today tab with everything else included. The Lifetime Pass, a one-time purchase, adds as many books as you like and the widgets. It is not a subscription.</dd>
        <dt>How do I restore my purchase?</dt>
        <dd>Settings (the gear on the History tab), then Restore purchase. Use the same Apple Account you bought it with.</dd>
        <dt>The widget isn't updating</dt>
        <dd>Open Laps once. The widget refreshes when you leave the app and every morning at 4:00. Widgets come with the Lifetime Pass.</dd>
        <dt>Where is my data?</dt>
        <dd>Only on your iPhone. Deleting the app deletes it.</dd>
        <dt>How do I change the language?</dt>
        <dd>Settings, then Language. The widgets always show English.</dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
